category: Libs
requires: libcloudproviders0 libglib2.0-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Library for integration of cloud storage providers (development)"
ldesc: "libcloudproviders is a DBus API that allows cloud storage sync clients to
expose their services. Clients such as file managers and desktop environments
can then provide integrated access to the cloud providers services."
external-source: libcloudproviders

